return {
    ["1.榜单数据将每分钟自动更新一次，确保信息及时。\n2.部分榜单支持按途径筛选，您可点击顶部的 “全部途径” 按钮进行切换。\n3.部分榜单支持地区排名查看，点击上方的对应地区页签即可切换。\n4.点击榜单底部的自身信息行，可快速定位并跳转到您当前所在的排名位置。\n5.点击其他非凡者的信息行，可查看对方形象；点击其头像，则可进一步查看该非凡者的个人名片。\n6.各段位达到天使之王，且排名总榜前30或途径前5，即可获得星辰之主段位，持续14天，段位分变化后若满足条件则刷新时长为14天。\n7.副本排行榜中，只有同服玩家组队通关副本，才会计入排行榜。"] = "1. Leaderboard data will be updated automatically every minute to ensure information is timely.\n2. Some leaderboards support filtering by Pathway; you can click the \"All Pathways\" button at the top to switch.\n3. Some leaderboards support viewing regional rankings; click the corresponding regional tab above to switch.\n4. Click your own information row at the bottom of the leaderboard to quickly locate and jump to your current ranking position.\n5. Click on other Beyonders' information rows to view their appearance; click on their avatar to further view that Beyonder's personal profile.\n6. Once you reach the King of Angels rank and are in the top 30 of the overall leaderboard or top 5 of a Pathway, you will obtain the Lord of Stars rank, which lasts for 14 days. If you still meet the conditions after your rank points change, the duration will be refreshed to 14 days.\n7. In the Dungeon leaderboard, only dungeons cleared by a team of players from the same server will be counted.",
    ["12倍返利"] = "12x Rebate",
    ["62装等竞技烙印装备自选箱"] = "Level 62 Competitive Brand Equipment Selection Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【世界灾厄】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>世界灾厄是周期性出现的世界级首领<Assistant_System>斯蒂姆之心</>。拥有独特的机制与奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>非凡者在<Assistant_Red>20级</>后，通过<Assistant_System>菜单-世界冒险-世界灾厄</>参与。每天12:00到24:00开放，推荐组队前往。每天<Assistant_Red>20:00~21:00</>参与可额外获得积分奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法奖励：</>每周进度积分奖励（每周重置），达到指定积分档位可领取<Assistant_System>世界冒险宝箱、绑定苏勒、非凡物质、蓝山晶石、星币</>等奖励。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【World Calamity】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Description: </> World Calamity is a periodic world-level boss, <Assistant_System>Heart of Steam</>. It has unique mechanics and rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2> How to Participate: </> After reaching <Assistant_Red>Level 20</>, Beyonders can participate via <Assistant_System>Menu - World Adventure - World Calamity</>. It is open daily from 12:00 to 24:00, and teaming up is recommended. Participating daily from <Assistant_Red>20:00 to 21:00</> grants additional point rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Rewards: </> Weekly progress point rewards (reset weekly). Reaching specified point tiers allows you to claim <Assistant_System>World Adventure Chests, Bound Gold Pounds, Beyonder Materials, Blue Mountain Crystals, Star Coins,</> etc.",
    ["<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\">……</>这几天，我的心脏总跳的很快，这是一种不安。从镇外的工厂下班回家，我不再敢走古堡那条路。镇子上的气氛很怪，每个人的情绪都很坏，告示板说，有一户人家被灭门了，他们说是流窜的通缉犯做的，但直觉告诉我，没那么简单。照理来说，按照我的探索精神，我应该去和亡魂、和灵去探究，但是，知道这个消息的那个瞬间，我居然在想，我会不会就是下一个？\n\n  这不是好的预兆，我想这是一个提示。"] = "<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\">...</>These past few days, my heart has been beating very fast; it's a sense of unease. After getting off work at the factory outside the town, I no longer dare to take the road by the old castle. The atmosphere in the town is very strange, everyone's mood is very bad. The notice board says that a family was wiped out; they say it was done by a fugitive on the run, but my intuition tells me it's not that simple. Logically speaking, with my spirit of exploration, I should go and investigate with the ghosts and spirits, but the moment I heard this news, I was actually thinking, could I be the next one? \n\n This is not a good omen; I think this is a hint.",
    ["<Italic>——你的双眼清澈，呼吸平稳，心跳正常。世界依旧如常运转，脚下的大地坚实而真实。 你还是你。</>"] = "<Italic>—Your eyes are clear, your breathing is steady, and your heartbeat is normal. The world continues to function as usual, and the earth beneath your feet is solid and real. You are still you.</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他沉默了，难道……不、不可试探……神？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He is silent, could it be... no, do not test... a god?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（打量你一眼）</>是送人还是自用？"] = "<P_Heart> (Takes a look at you) </> Is this a gift, or for yourself?",
    ["<P_Heart>（这家伙虽然平时很随意，但真正做起事情来还挺靠谱的嘛。根据他的描述尝试下。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This guy is usually very casual, but he's actually quite reliable when it comes to real work. Let's try it based on his description.)</>",
